OL,3,GNEWSADad says SEND pupils missing
OL,4,Aschool over taxi delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe father of a boy with special
OL,7,Feducational needs has criticised a
OL,8,Fcouncil after waiting two weeks for a
OL,9,Ftaxi to be arranged to take him to
OL,10,Fschool.
OL,12,FRichard said his son, Archie, who is
OL,13,Fautistic, has only attended school for
OL,14,Ftwo days this term after Oxfordshire
OL,15,FCounty Council failed to arrange the
OL,16,Fhome-to-school transport he is entitled
OL,17,Fto.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
