OL,3,GNEWSADad says SEND pupils missing
OL,4,Aschool over taxi delays
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to Richard, "dozens of
OL,7,Ffamilies" are affected by similar
OL,8,Fproblems at Archie's school after
OL,9,Fissues with the council-contracted taxi
OL,10,Fservice.
OL,12,FSean Gaul, cabinet member for
OL,13,Fchildren's services at the county
OL,14,Fcouncil, said 200 post-16 students were
OL,15,F"on track to be assigned travel by
OL,16,FMonday".
